u003Cstrong\u003Eclip_l.safetensors\u003C/strong\u003E in your\u003Cstrong\u003E \u003C/strong\u003E\u003Cu\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EComfyUI/models/clip/\u003C/strong\u003E\u003C/u\u003E\u003Cu\u003E directory: \u0026nbsp;\u003C/u\u003E\u003Ca href=\u0022https://huggingface.co/comfyanonymous/flux_text_encoders/tree/main\u0022 target=\u0022_blank\u0022\u003E\u003Cu\u003Ehttps://huggingface.co/comfyanonymous/flux_text_encoders/tree/main\u003C/u\u003E\u003C/a\u003E\u003C/p\u003E\u003Cp\u003EIf you have more than 32GB ram, FP16 version is recommended and y\u003Cu\u003Eou can use \u003C/u\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003Et5xxl_f\u003C/strong\u003E\u003Cu\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003Ep16\u003C/strong\u003E\u003C/u\u003E\u003Cu\u003E.safetensors\u003C/u\u003E instead. For lower memory usage but the \u003Cstrong\u003Et5xxl_fp8_e4m3fn \u003C/strong\u003Eis recommended.\u003C/p\u003E\u003Cp\u003E3- Download VAE and put it under the \u003Cu\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EComfyUI/models/vae/\u003C/strong\u003E\u003C/u\u003E folder: \u0026nbsp;\u003Ca href=\u0022https://huggingface.co/black-forest-labs/FLUX.1-schnell/blob/main/ae.sft\u0022 target=\u0022_blank\u0022\u003Ehttps://huggingface.co/black-forest-labs/FLUX.1-schnell/blob/main/ae.sft\u003C/a\u003E \u003C/p\u003E\u003Cp\u003E4- Download the \u003Cstrong\u003Eflux1-schnell.sft \u003C/strong\u003Eand place it under \u003Cu\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EComfyUI/models/unet f\u003C/strong\u003E\u003C/u\u003Eolder: \u0026nbsp; \u003Ca href=\u0022https://huggingface.co/black-forest-labs/FLUX.1-schnell/tree/main\u0022 target=\u0022_blank\u0022\u003Ehttps://huggingface.co/black-forest-labs/FLUX.1-schnell/tree/main\u003C/a\u003E \u003C/p\u003E\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cbr\u003E\u003C/p\u003E\u003Cp\u003EYou can use the flux-dev version as well but schnell versions offers 1 to 4 steps and it has Apache 2.0 licence.\u003C/p\u003E\u003Cp\u003EHuge thanks to Black Forest Labs and Comfy UI teams!\u003C/p\u003E\u003Cp\u003EFor further details please check: \u0026nbsp;\u003C/p\